      "appearance": "二十七岁，甄家二少爷，瘦长脸，眼下发青，一身熨得笔挺却洗得发旧的白绸长衫，见人先笑三分，笑意却到不了眼睛，手指被烟熏得发黄。",
      "relation": "死者甄崇山的二儿子；大哥甄家骏落水之后，你成了甄家唯一的儿子，父亲却从没正眼看过你。",
      "publicInfo": "甄家祺，二十七岁，甄家二少爷，寨主甄崇山的次子，在县城念过两年洋学堂。",
      "portrait": "cinematic film still portrait of a 27-year-old Chinese man, 1936 Republic-era rural western Hunan, second son of a wealthy mountain clan, long thin face, faint dark circles under the eyes, smooth youthful cheeks, short hair slicked back and parted at the side, worn white silk long gown (changshan) with a white hemp mourning sash, nicotine-yellowed fingers, polite tired smile that does not reach the eyes, candlelit mourning hall softly blurred behind him, half-length shot",
